    {
     "line": 13,
     "text": "**After (Correct - from Chiaki):**"
    },
    {
     "line": 123,
     "text": "- See Chiaki's `av_packet_parse()` functions"
    },
    {
     "line": 142,
     "text": "### Chiaki Source Files"
    },
    {
     "line": 143,
     "text": "- `/chiaki-complete/lib/include/chiaki/takion.h` - Protocol definitions"
    },
    {
     "line": 144,
     "text": "- `/chiaki-complete/lib/src/takion.c` - Main implementation"
    },
    {
     "line": 151,
     "text": "### Key Constants from Chiaki"
    },
    {
     "line": 163,
     "text": "2. **Add logging** - Dump packet hex for Wireshark comparison with Chiaki"
    }
