     "line": 3,
     "text": "## ✅ Completed Implementation (Based on Chiaki)"
    },
    {
     "line": 5,
     "text": "This implementation is a **pure Swift** version of Chiaki's PlayStation Remote Play streaming protocol, ready for testing."
    },
    {
     "line": 44,
     "text": "- **Status:** Implemented from Chiaki"
    },
    {
     "line": 57,
     "text": "Based on Chiaki `takion.c` (lines 175-660)"
    },
    {
     "line": 72,
     "text": "#### ✅ Packet Types (from Chiaki `takion.c:51-62`)"
    },
    {
     "line": 79,
     "text": "#### ✅ Chunk Types (from Chiaki `takion.c:102-109`)"
    },
    {
     "line": 92,
     "text": "**Reference:** Chiaki describes this as \"VERY similar to SCTP, see RFC 4960\""
    },
    {
     "line": 99,
     "text": "Based on Chiaki `takion.c` (lines 1233-1440)"
    },
    {
     "line": 102,
     "text": "- **v7** - PS4 (from Chiaki `chiaki_takion_v7_av_packet_parse`)"
    },
    {
     "line": 103,
     "text": "- **v9** - PS5 (from Chiaki `chiaki_takion_v9_av_packet_parse`)"
    },
    {
     "line": 104,
     "text": "- **v12** - PS5 newer (from Chiaki `chiaki_takion_v12_av_packet_parse`)"
    },
    {
     "line": 135,
     "text": "#### ✅ Key Position Tracking (ChiakiKeyState)"
    },
    {
     "line": 137,
     "text": "- Based on Chiaki's `chiaki_key_state_request_pos`"
    },
    {
     "line": 170,
     "text": "Based on Chiaki's GKCrypt implementation"
    },
    {
     "line": 191,
     "text": "**Note:** Simplified GMAC using HMAC-SHA256. Chiaki uses full AES-GMAC."
    },
    {
     "line": 253,
     "text": "├── Takion.swift              ✅ SCTP-like protocol (based on Chiaki takion.c)"
    },
    {
     "line": 254,
     "text": "├── AVPacketParser.swift      ✅ v7/v9/v12 parsers (based on Chiaki parsers)"
    },
    {
     "line": 325,
     "text": "### ⚠️ Differences from Chiaki"
